# Server conventions

- Source of truth: `server/data/tickets.json`. Regenerate with `node server/data/generate.mjs`.
- Multi-select query params are comma-separated (`status`, `category`, `priority`, `location`).
- `GET /api/tickets` must return `facets` including `hotspots` and `needsAttention` for OpsGlance.
- `PUT /api/tickets` must validate before write; never silently wipe on bad payload.
- `PATCH /api/tickets/:id` updates status only (`Open` | `In Progress` | `Closed`).
- Keep ESM + Express style consistent with `server/src/index.js`.
- Prefer small, explicit helpers (`parseList`, `readTickets`, `writeTickets`) over new frameworks.
